  "quickAnswerHtml": "<strong>November to February</strong> is the best time for most of Thailand—cool, dry and comfortable for cities and beaches—but crowds and prices peak then. March to May gets very hot, while <strong>June to October</strong> brings showers in short bursts, with better deals and fewer visitors. Both sides of the coast have different rainy seasons, so you can play them off each other."
